# valid/race-loser-cleanup-aborts-success
profile own
failure cleanup typed Cleanup
scope.begin caller async
scope.begin race
new loser_input L
on.destroy loser_input 'fail typed Cleanup'
future loser void - bound loser_input
future winner new W bound
future.start loser
await uncommitted winner
future.cancel loser
assert.failure Cancelled Cleanup
scope.unwind race cleanup
assert.failure Cleanup
check LW
scope.end caller
